# Google indexing for SwishIt

- Do **not** tell the user to use Search Console “Request indexing” — it does not work for this project.
- Prefer the existing **sitemap** (`https://swishit.onrender.com/sitemap.xml`, generated by `src/app/sitemap.ts`) for discovery and crawl reminders.
- Do not change `robots.txt` or the sitemap unless there is a real technical problem.
- Favicon / logo updates in Google Search results can take days to weeks after deploy; autocomplete may update sooner than SERP icons.
- Render is on a **paid plan** (no sleep). Do not treat free-tier spin-down / sleep-time `robots.txt Disallow: /` as a current cause. `.github/workflows/keep-awake.yml` is optional insurance, not required.
- If Google lists the homepage with “No page information,” prefers `/court-call` as the brand result, or shows a stale favicon, assume crawl/index lag or outdated Google cache—not a client redirect. Homepage should remain the WebSite/Organization hub; game pages use breadcrumbs back to Home.
